{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"collection","externalID":"PushwooshLiveActivities","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshLiveActivities"}],"symbolKind":"module","title":"PushwooshLiveActivities","roleHeading":"Framework"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Real-time iOS Live Activities powered by push notifications."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/Examples"],"title":"Getting Started"},{"title":"Classes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivitiesImplementationSetup"]},{"title":"Protocols","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityContentState"]},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/AnyCodable","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/DefaultLiveActivityAttributes","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributeData","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityContentStateData"],"title":"Structures"},{"title":"Extended Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshBridge"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PushwooshLiveActivities integrates Apple’s ActivityKit framework to deliver real-time updates to Live Activities on the Lock Screen and Dynamic Island. Live Activities provide persistent, glanceable information that users can track without opening your app."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The module handles token registration, activity lifecycle management, and push notification delivery automatically. It supports both custom activity attributes and a default configuration for cross-platform scenarios."}]},{"name":"Important","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivitiesImplementationSetup\/setup(_:)","isActive":true},{"text":" for every attributes type your app uses ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"at launch","type":"text"}]},{"text":" (in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)"},{"type":"text","text":" or the SwiftUI "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"App.init"},{"type":"text","text":"), not lazily when a screen appears. Only a type registered in the current session is reconnected to its already-running activities so their push token can be re-uploaded after a cold start — for example an activity that started, or was scheduled to start, while the app was terminated. A type registered later (e.g. in a view’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onAppear"},{"type":"text","text":") can’t receive remote updates until that screen is opened. ActivityKit exposes running activities only through the concrete "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Activity<Attributes>"},{"text":" generic and does not persist the set of types across launches, so the SDK cannot reconnect a type it hasn’t been told about this session. The call is idempotent — registering at launch and again per-screen is safe.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities/documentation/PushwooshLiveActivities/PushwooshBridge":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities\/pushwooshbridge","role":"collection","title":"PushwooshBridge","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshBridge","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities/documentation/PushwooshLiveActivities/DefaultLiveActivityAttributes":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DefaultLiveActivityAttributes"}],"title":"DefaultLiveActivityAttributes","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DefaultLiveActivityAttributes","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/DefaultLiveActivityAttributes","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A flexible structure for defining Live Activity content dynamically."}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities\/defaultliveactivityattributes"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities/documentation/PushwooshLiveActivities/PushwooshLiveActivitiesImplementationSetup/setup(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities\/pushwooshliveactivitiesimplementationsetup\/setup(_:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Configures Live Activities with custom attributes.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivitiesImplementationSetup\/setup(_:)","fragments